      {
        "id": 22083,
        "name": "beevolant",
        "username": "beevolant",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-02T12:55:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Our local gaming shop has games days every once in a while (with food and door prizes and lots of games available to demo) and I demoed the game with people earlier this month out there and met other Sentinels fans who had bought the game at GenCon! <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Most game stores are run by people who love games and are just as excited about awesome new games as the rest of us.</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/evandan457\">@evandan457</a> - let us know how the demos with your college gaming group go!</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:56:08.826Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
