        "raw": "Our local gaming shop has games days every once in a while (with food and door prizes and lots of games available to demo) and I demoed the game with people earlier this month out there and met other Sentinels fans who had bought the game at GenCon! :) \n\nMost game stores are run by people who love games and are just as excited about awesome new games as the rest of us. \n\n@evandan457 - let us know how the demos with your college gaming group go!",
